draw_text_half_trans (FUN_0041033a): faithful transparent texel spans

Completes patch 580 for the TRANSPARENT span blitter used by the SPRT/sprite
handler sub_4114c0 (start-light lamps, LIGHTSUR glow, shadow sprites) and any
draw_face path that blends. The original loop (asm 0x41050c-0x410521 and the
clipped twin) is the same packed-ecx walk as draw_text_half PLUS the
semi-transparency guard `test dl,0xf; je skip`: texels with a zero LOW NIBBLE
leave the framebuffer untouched. Ghidra rendered it as CONCAT/SCARRY spaghetti
whose running texture pointer got clobbered with the fetched CLUT byte after
the first opaque pixel -> the whole sprite pass painted black/garbage (the
start-light LED circles stayed black; reference shows the lit lamps).

